DOM vs Virtual DOM

1. DOM 
-->fully refresh page to do any single change

2. Virtual DOM
-->make the copy of DOM do the changes in the copy DOM and then compare with real dom if change then only update that thing 
-->only no refresh is done makes the webpage performance fast


